HYPOT - adds a numeric-function keyword:  r = HYPOT(dx, dy).

Language features
  - SEED_KEYWORD (SEED_KW_NUMFN) - a seed that adds a new FUNCTION keyword
  - used directly, with no SEED / CALL
  - auto-registered at startup from /SEED

Try it
  PRINT HYPOT(3, 4)            -> 5

Build it on the machine
  grow hypot          # -> build/HYPOT.SED
It is also prebuilt in /SEED as HYPOT.SED, ready to use.

